abstract: >-
  A practical Quality Engineering framework for treating production prompts as
  versioned, testable and governable software artifacts. The work covers golden
  datasets, deterministic-first assertions, structured-output contracts,
  semantic evaluation, LLM-as-a-Judge governance, prompt regression testing,
  model and parameter comparison, RAG and tool-use prompt tests, prompt
  injection, permanent security regressions, red teaming, CI/CD quality gates,
  observability, production feedback and prompt change governance.